<Base title="I Will Bloom guided cancer support journal · €38" description="Discover the €38 I Will Bloom journal, its guided pages and thoughtful accompanying extras. For yourself or someone you love."><script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(product)}/><section class="pageintro"><p class="eyebrow">For yourself, or someone you love</p><h1>The I Will Bloom Journal</h1><p>Gentle structure for the thoughts, feelings and ordinary moments that belong to you.</p></section><section class="section container split product-details"><figure class="product-photo"><img src="/assets/verified/journal.webp" width="900" height="1600" alt="I Will Bloom journal showing the actual cloud cover, gold lettering and white spiral binding" fetchpriority="high"/></figure><div class="copy"><p class="eyebrow">A little space to begin</p><h2>Support for your mind — not just your schedule.</h2><p>A5 hardback with a white spiral binding. Guided reflection and everyday practical pages, with room to use the journal in your own way.</p><p class="price">€38.00</p><a class="btn" href="/#shop">Preview your order →</a><p class="smallnote">EU delivery estimate €6 · UK €10 · rest of world €22 for one journal. No extra IVA is added in this preview; tax and delivery arrangements will be verified before checkout opens.</p></div></section><section class="prose"><h2>A thoughtful set of extras</h2><p>The existing product listing describes a handmade bookmark, retractable black-ink pen, small colouring-pencil set, Bloom Markers, a gift card with space for your own words, and Load Lighteners for sharing practical requests.</p><p>The contents will be checked against current packed stock before the shop opens.</p><h2>Inside the journal</h2><p>Daily pages make room for energy, hydration, how you feel and little moments worth remembering. Other sections include appointment-preparation prompts, Moments of Wonder, Unspoken Words and milestones.</p><p><a href="/the-purpose/">Explore the purpose and pages →</a></p><h2>A gift with space to be themselves</h2><p>A journal does not ask someone to explain their feelings or share what they write. Give it without a deadline or an expectation that it must be used every day.</p><p><a href="/bloom-library/a-gift-without-expectations/">Read about giving without expectations →</a></p><h2>Questions before choosing?</h2><p><a href="/contactiwb/">Contact Rachel</a> about the journal, gift enquiries or organisational purchases.</p></section></Base>